      "id": "SG-osaka-blocks-header",
      "name": "Block Header Data Structure",
      "description": "Header portion of a block on the chain, containing metadata and cryptographic commitments to the block's contents. Includes fields for PoS consensus, EIP-1559 base fee, EIP-4844 blob gas tracking, beacon chain integration, and EIP-7685 requests hash.",
      "invariants": [
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-003",
          "text": "Header struct is immutable (slotted_freezable decorator enforces frozen dataclass semantics)."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-004",
          "text": "In post-merge (PoS) forks, ommers_hash is always EMPTY_OMMER_HASH."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-005",
          "text": "In PoS, difficulty is set to a constant value (0)."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-006",
          "text": "In PoS, nonce is set to zero."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-007",
          "text": "gas_used must be less than or equal to gas_limit."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-008",
          "text": "gas_limit can only be adjusted by a factor of 1/1024 from the parent block's gas_limit, up to a maximum of 30 million gas."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-009",
          "text": "Base fees (EIP-1559) are burned and do not go to the coinbase address."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-010",
          "text": "state_root is computed via the state_root() function as the root of the Merkle-Patricia Trie representing Ethereum world state."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-011",
          "text": "transactions_root is computed via the root() function over the Merkle-Patricia trie of transactions."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-012",
          "text": "receipt_root is computed via the root() function over the Merkle-Patricia trie of receipts."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-013",
          "text": "requests_hash is computed as the SHA2-256 hash of all collected requests via compute_requests_hash (EIP-7685)."
        },
        {
          "id": "INV-osaka-blocks-014",
          "text": "excess_blob_gas is a running total that can decrease to a minimum of zero but never goes negative (EIP-4844)."
        }
      ],
